message: "Cite the exact JR AutoRAG release or Git commit used."
title: "JR AutoRAG: A Local-First RAG Workbench"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Reed
    given-names: "Jonathan R."
repository-code: "https://github.com/JonathanRReed/JR-AutoRAG"
url: "https://jonathanrreed.com/projects/jr-autorag/"
version: 0.1.0
license: FSL-1.1-MIT
abstract: >-
  JR AutoRAG is a local-first workbench for document ingestion, hybrid
  retrieval, grounded answers with citations, trace inspection, evaluation,
  security controls, and evidence-based client handoff. It combines a React
  admin console with a FastAPI backend and local or OpenAI-compatible model
  providers.
keywords:
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - local AI
  - citations
  - RAG evaluation
  - document retrieval
